doc:InformationContentEntity schema1:text "The study proposes a SCADA-integrated framework for fault prediction in spiral steel pipe manufacturing using fuzzy comprehensive evaluation and artificial neural networks, with dynamic health analysis, synthetic SCADA data, and multi-week sensor windows for predicting faults up to four weeks in advance." .
